WEBVTT

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:05.750
I am disappointed, Werewolf Queen.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:09.710
As am I, Vampire King.

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:15.350
You, who fought the Demon Lords
and protected this land eons ago,

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:17.180
now choose to follow such a foolish path.

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.980
That was nothing more
than desperation to survive.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.230
And nothing has changed since then.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.480
Neither have we changed.

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:29.480
Just like our forebears, we will battle on
until we've eradicated the Chaos.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:32.700
Except that I don't wish to fight anyone.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.320
Neither with you, as well.

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.200
We're done talking.

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:41.870
Please wait.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:44.870
And you are?

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:47.710
Me?

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:50.130
My name is Yana.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.380
She's a descendant of the Black Witch.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:53.880
The Black Witch...

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:59.310
Your Majesty, I do believe
you've been duped by the Mage Academy.

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:04.020
Once harmony is restored,
it will mean the end of both Crests and Art.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:07.980
As someone who's shed
her own blood, I'm sure...

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:09.730
So what if I did?

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:14.490
If it means leaving
a peaceful world to my children,

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:16.820
I'll gladly relinquish my powers.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:18.240
Huh?

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:20.740
Oh, please! Such lip service!

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:24.910
Listen...

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:28.540
That faux-wolf will surely attack soon.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:30.750
Just get rid of her
while you have the chance!

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:32.550
That I cannot do.

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:35.630
After all, she's my invited guest.

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:38.800
Then I'll do it myself!

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.430
That's fine, isn't it?

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:47.900
What's taking Mother so long?

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:50.070
I wonder what they're talking about?

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.570
We came all this way to meet her!

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:55.700
A storm's brewing.

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:57.200
Are you scared?

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.570
Heck, no! I'm all grown up now!

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:07.000
Good evening, sweet puppies.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:46.770
Welcome to my castle.

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:50.520
I assign you the rank of guard, Sir Theo,
but you don't have to join the troops.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.270
Do you have a task for me?

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:55.400
A task? Let's see...

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:59.990
How about I have you do guard duty
whenever I leave the castle.

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:03.450
When I'm here,
you can do whatever you want.

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:04.370
Right...

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:08.240
My name is Laura Hardry.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:11.250
I am somewhat versed in Abjuration Magic.

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:13.500
Helga Piarosa.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.920
I studied Life Magic at the Mage Academy.

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.250
I'm Colleen Messala.

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:20.880
Oh, my specialty is alchemy magic.

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.510
We've heard the rumors about you.

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:27.010
You belived once you mastered the basics
you'd learn how to apply them on your own,

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:28.890
and so you switched from major to major.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.020
You must be quite talented.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.560
Not as much as you three.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.150
There's no time for idle chitchat.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:40.530
We're having company tonight.

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:43.200
You'll be attending the welcome banquet.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:45.030
Who will be coming?

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:49.080
The prince of the small continent
of Dartagnia, Lord Milza Kuces.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.830
He's been traveling in secret
for the last five years,

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:54.040
and he's stopping by before heading home.

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:57.210
Artuk's neighbor across the sea.

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:59.800
They've been on friendly terms
since ancient times, right?

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:02.090
He's an esteemed guest.

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:04.930
Be on your best behavior.

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:09.970
I don't know who assassinated
those two archdukes,

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:13.600
but it goes to show that
anybody can still become emperor.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.440
That's right. Including you, Lord Milza.

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:22.070
To become emperor, one needs geographical
advantages and luck on one's side.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:28.070
Dartagnia is a small continent,
easy to protect but ill-suited for attacking.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:34.460
Should you become emperor, Lord Villar,
I would be pleased to serve you.

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:37.170
I value aesthetics over ambition.

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:42.510
Although, if I became emperor
as a result of living a most beautiful life,

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:44.090
I would gladly accept it.

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:45.970
That sets my mind at ease.

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:49.720
If you had no intention of becoming
emperor, Lord Villar...

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:54.480
I would've taken your Crest
back to Dartagnia with me.

00:05:57.310 --> 00:06:00.440
If I were to cross swords
with you, Lord Milzer,

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:02.320
I'd likely have no chance of winning.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.950
I hear you've fought a wide array of foes.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:09.200
I believe you've achieved
the court rank of viscount?

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:10.950
But that's amazing!

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:13.200
Who's he?

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:17.460
A Knight Guard who recently began
serving me. His name is Theo.

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:19.580
I've heard many rumors about him.

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:23.460
To think he'd give up his viscount ranking
for a single mage.

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:28.090
I have no interest
in those who lack ambition.

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:33.850
That's how much value Theo sees in Siluca.

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:36.430
In that young girl?

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:43.980
That reminds me, Viscount Lassic David
has begun his conquest of Savis.

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:46.700
I've seen this Lord Lassic's
performance on the battlefield.

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:50.160
His troops are formidable,
and he leads them well.

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:53.280
Lord Villar, you've gained a fine ally,
wouldn't you say?

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:55.790
No doubt, he's an ally,

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:59.790
but Lord Lassic is only holding
Sir Theo's court rank for now.

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:00.960
What?

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:08.170
Lord Lassic is ambitious, but he's even
offered up that ambition to Sir Theo.

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:10.260
Unthinkable...

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:13.890
Who would entrust their ambition to
someone deprived of it?

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:17.810
Eons ago...

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:21.020
The Demon Lords that emerged in Artuk

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:25.940
wreaked havoc and destruction for almost
a decade, until dispersing naturally.

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:29.700
In those days, the citizens of Artuk
fortified their villages,

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:32.450
confronting the Chaos head on
in an effort to thwart it.

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:35.080
Around this time, a great witch appeared...

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:37.580
A witch? You don't mean a mage?

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:42.330
They summon otherworldly projections,
such as spirits and demons,

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:44.790
and endow them with wisdom and power.

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:47.840
There are Black Witches who prefer
to be connected to the demon world...

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:54.220
but the witches of Artuk are White Witches,
who swore to never link to the demon world.

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:57.720
Aside from the witches,
powerful Artists also appeared.

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:01.480
In particular,
vampires with their powers of immortality,

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.940
and the werewolves,
with their powers of regeneration,

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:07.480
are said to have fought
on equal terms with the Demon Lords.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:13.870
The Constance family treated them well,
gave them complete autonomy,

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:15.830
and even signed a pact with them.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:18.830
The people of Artuk sure are strong.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:26.090
The people of Systina are too helpless
against the demon world and the Rossini clan.

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:32.220
There's no doubt in my mind that you
will rally your people to make a stand!

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:38.100
- Thanks.
- Oh, no...

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:41.390
Both of you,
come to the Audience Hall at once.

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:47.070
This is the elder of the White Witches,
Lady Zelma.

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:50.240
You can just call me Old Hag.

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:53.450
So are you the new mage?

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:57.830
Look at you, being forced to wear
young Villar's tasteless outfit!

00:08:58.410 --> 00:08:59.830
I'm used to it now.

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.830
Theo. Siluca.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:08.960
In my stead, I want you to head
to the Forest of Eternal Darkness at once.

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:11.340
Right. What's the nature of our business?

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:14.970
The werewolves have left
their village en masse.

00:09:14.970 --> 00:09:17.850
They're heading for
the Forest of Eternal Darkness.

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:21.850
I've spoken with their queen,
but she won't say a word.

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:27.190
There hasn't been bad blood like this since
the ancient pact went into effect.

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:31.190
Normally, that forest is
the vampires' territory...

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:35.700
But I can't help feeling that
something terrible is about to happen.

00:09:39.740 --> 00:09:42.910
Mother, I'm picking up
Luna and Emma's scent.

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:43.750
Yes.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:52.170
Who knew you'd show up
over a pair of mangy mutts?

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:02.810
Are your children that important to you?

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:05.310
You can just bear more
if you need them, right?

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.150
Return my daughters!

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:09.980
Did I not tell you to come alone?

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:16.320
I'm going alone from this point on.

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:17.200
Mother!

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:20.030
I'm ordering you as your clan leader.

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:21.830
Ion, wait here.

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:25.080
All right.

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:30.750
So many of our comrades
have lost their lives fighting the Chaos.

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:35.170
But I will not allow my children
to succumb before I do.

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:46.850
Are you members of the werewolf clan?

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:48.520
What if we are?

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:52.110
We're emissaries of Villar, the Earl of Artuk.

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:57.450
We came upon hearing of the feud between
the werewolf clan and the Vampire King.

00:10:57.860 --> 00:10:59.360
Tell us, what's happened here?

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:03.120
Nothing that concerns you!
Now get the hell out of here!

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:06.450
Or else we won't guarantee your survival!

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:13.250
My name is Theo Cornaro.

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:15.880
On behalf of the Earl of Artuk,

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.510
I am here to meet with
the Werewolf Queen and the Vampire King.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:21.720
These two are my guests.

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:23.810
Would you mind letting them through?

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:27.060
Are you... the Vampire King?

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:27.980
Indeed I am.

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:30.900
To be precise,
I guess you could say I'm his shadow,.

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:35.900
Give back my mother and sisters!

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:41.200
Emissaries, please come with me.

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:44.120
Wha–

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:55.000
I promise you, as the Earl of Artuk's
emissaries, we'll do the best that we can.

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:05.390
Just try harming a single hair
on my mother's or sisters' heads!

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:08.770
I swear I'll chase you to the ends of the earth
and shred you to pieces,

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:10.850
a thousand times more!

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:48.060
Just how durable
are you werewolves, anyway?

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:53.770
You're such a fool...
I despise people like you!

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:57.070
I'm sure someone like you
could never understand.

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:02.900
Well, let's see how long you can hold out.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:07.580
Once you die,
it'll be your precious daughters' turn!

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:14.540
Welcome to my castle.

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.750
Please forgive us for our sudden intrusion.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:20.380
- I am–
- No need to tell me.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.340
Just cut to the chase.

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:28.350
Lord Dmitrie, Vampire King,

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:31.560
where is your ally,
the Werewolf Queen, right now?

00:13:32.810 --> 00:13:34.980
It was Yana who summoned her.

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:39.610
It's not my thing,
but everyone has their own style.

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:44.490
If that doesn't sit well with you two,
feel free to do as you wish.

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:46.110
Yana?

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:49.950
One more thing...
I'd like you to convey this to Earl Villar.

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:55.460
Our goal is to return to the Dark Ages,
rife with the Ultimate Chaos.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:56.620
Our goal?

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:01.460
Unless the Crests are shattered,
all Lords shall become our enemies.

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:02.300
But why?

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:07.550
Weren't you the one who fought
that Ultimate Chaos two thousand years ago?

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:14.480
All I wanted was for this twilight era
to continue through eternity.

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:20.980
But eventually, the Crests will be fused,
and the Emperor's Crest will come into being.

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:23.360
So if order and harmony are restored,

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:26.740
Chaos will vanish
and Artists will lose their power?

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:27.860
Right.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:31.490
And for me, it means a permanent ending.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:35.870
I am afraid to die, you see.

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:41.250
Are you the one who caused
the Grand Hall Tragedy?

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:45.050
Sir Theo!

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:47.680
Do you intend to fight me?

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:50.350
Although I'm no match...

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:55.060
I am not fond of fighting.

00:14:57.190 --> 00:14:59.310
The queen is in the cellar.

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:02.900
If you go now, you can probably save
those she's trying to protect.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:20.670
You don't have enough power left
to regenerate, do you?

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:25.300
If I use your Chaos Core,
I might be able to summon the Demon Lords!

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:29.130
Are you...

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:33.050
So you're the Black Witch, huh?

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:37.480
Dmitrie's guests?

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:41.600
If you wish to ask questions,
start by telling me who you are!

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:45.730
I'm Theo Cornaro.
And she is Siluca Meletes.

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:48.150
We're emissaries of Earl Villar!

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.500
The Vampire King just left.

00:15:58.250 --> 00:15:59.250
Huh?

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.000
After making me do all that?

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:07.510
So I was just a pawn to sacrifice, eh?

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:11.760
Fine. Then I'll just do as I please.

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:15.140
Go, you two!

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:19.850
Surge!

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:39.620
Having a man shield you!

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:44.380
How I envy you!

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:46.170
Die!

00:16:48.590 --> 00:16:49.460
Block!

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:52.550
Sir Theo!

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:09.900
He deflected it?

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:24.750
Ivy! Vines!

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:36.140
No way!

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:43.940
Slice it!

00:17:58.280 --> 00:17:59.240
Let's go!

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:01.040
How dare you hurt our mother!

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:05.870
You're just puppies!

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:07.540
Get down here!

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:08.750
We'll rip you to shreds!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:12.420
I'll take you two on another time!

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:13.720
Surge!

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:22.810
Let's go after her!

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:24.600
Let's go after her, Mother!

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:31.270
Mother, are you all right?

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:32.900
Mother, we're so sorry!

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:35.400
What am I to do with you?

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:38.280
Take these two outside the forest.

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:39.700
I promise.

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:42.120
Thank you.

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:51.800
Emma... Luna...

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:56.470
Promise me you'll live strongly and wisely...

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:19.610
Clara was a great queen,
and a strong, kind-hearted mother.

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:26.370
She loved her clan, her family,
and fought gallantly to rescue her daughters.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:30.000
We will carry on her legacy, and her life.

00:19:54.570 --> 00:20:00.110
You two brought my sisters, as well as
my mother's soul, back to us.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:04.080
I thank you.

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:21.220
The residents of the forest
pledged their allegiance to us,

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:23.640
and will come to our aid in times of war.

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:24.510
Is that right?

00:20:25.010 --> 00:20:29.520
Although I'm sure they believe
the Vampire King will return one day.

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:30.520
Probably...

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:35.400
Governing the Forest of Eternal Darkness,
and clearing a path to the demon world...

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:38.900
Lord Villar is really working us hard, huh?

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:42.030
Though you did accept those tasks,
didn't you, Sir Theo?

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:45.030
Systina is also considered
part of the demon world.

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:47.160
I thought I'd learn a thing or two.

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:50.040
Also, I've heard from Lady Margaret.

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:55.540
The White Witch tried to pursue Yana,
but was unable to capture her.

00:20:56.840 --> 00:20:58.920
That Black Witch has terrifying power...

00:21:00.220 --> 00:21:01.050
Siluca...

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:03.300
I'm going to become stronger.

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:08.260
Because I know there are battles
that I cannot afford to lose.

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:13.140
Right. I'm going to become stronger, too.

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:17.730
Fortunately, there's no shortage
of challenges in this forest.

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:22.570
After all, it's the fearsome playground
left behind by the Vampire King.

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:24.740
That's perfectly fine by me.

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:30.080
For it means that you'll be running me
into the ground once again.

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:35.460
